description=Diagnostic-only companion for Project Viewpoint. Detects Viewpoint, ZombieBuddy and the game version, logs [VPGeometryFix] lines and, in debug mode, dumps read-only information about the tile/object you target. Does NOT change rendering, gameplay, save games or any game/Viewpoint file. Ctrl+Shift+F9 debug, Ctrl+Shift+F10 inspect, Ctrl+Shift+F11 hover, Ctrl+Shift+F8 Viewpoint class inventory.
